          "kind": "derived",
          "step": "Subdivide every edge of a Vertex Cover instance. The blue original vertices dominate the red subdivision vertices exactly when they cover all original edges. A single bag with all original vertices and an attached bag for each subdivision gives treewidth at most max(n−1, 2) for original order n. The new explicit encoding has polynomial size."
